 with **almond flour** for a tender, nutty crumb, or mix in toasted sliced or chopped nuts (such as almonds, pecans, or walnuts) for added crunch.\n5. **Experiment with warm spices:** A pinch of cinnamon, nutmeg, or cardamom adds subtle warmth and depth that pairs naturally with chocolate and caramel tones.","input_tokens":19897,"latency_ms":53395,"observations":[{"excerpt":{"chars":2000,"sha256":"b5e41a4030488ed7688a752adb2c10e8de4246b7ec51fbf54ad897a595d201d5","withheld":"dataset text; see README"},"observation_id":"obs_dDmq1EgqurDXQpYSuWCcW","occurred_at":"2023-05-27T07:11:00Z","source_object_id":"38146c39/answer_772472c8:1"},{"excerpt":{"chars":231,"sha256":"a2defc3729f0f25e5f391479917e92965b1d346b1091a9c0c16963c84d117835","withheld":"dataset text; see README"},"observation_id":"obs_opnK7YvOeRcFfWBOgUsvu","occurred_at":"2023-05-27T07:11:00Z","source_object_id":"38146c39/answer_772472c8:0"},{"excerpt":{"chars":2000,"sha256":"dac365da4174f21371ec21c8156327297d352dbab6fd52fc1c0cace1ef8087c4","withheld":"dataset text; see README"},"observation_id":"obs_5GSxXW4mEPFPu7dVts3EN","occurred_at":"2023-05-30T15:55:00Z","source_object_id":"38146c39/87aaee77:1"},{"excerpt":{"chars":2000,"sha256":"f921f364841edd4f8b8b7edf90aa76e8ae9255b9eea7054220d34786fc1ba08c","withheld":"dataset text; see README"},"observation_id":"obs_ML8IiCYIjN0X3AV3JYE7_","occurred_at":"2023-05-27T07:11:00Z","source_object_id":"38146c39/answer_772472c8:13"},{"excerpt":{"chars":1948,"sha256":"58554a4c1b5a72b3f2231db7f1298cc0ee0ef8e7fc7c267e1e6092c1fccb514f","withheld":"dataset text; see README"},"observation_id":"obs_13lJS89ETYwMUaJIfPWgz","occurred_at":"2023-05-30T15:55:00Z","source_object_id":"38146c39/87aaee77:3"},{"excerpt":{"chars":2000,"sha256":"b33f9da7e002fbb6661e8d3434b39c0f7a7b3c32ccc6e8094bb8cd812d116232","withheld":"dataset text; see README"},"observation_id":"obs_hxUH15fkRVY5rLoSg51kt","occurred_at":"2023-05-25T05:40:00Z","source_object_id":"38146c39/5263736d_1:5"},{"excerpt":{"chars":2000,"s